u = 0 \unit{MeV/c^2}, m_\Sigma = 1197.35 \unit{MeV/c^2}, m_\Lambda = 1116.058 \unit{MeV/c^2}, and 	au_n = 10^3 \unit{s}. Estimate the decay rate \lambda(\Sigma^- -> \Lambda e^-  ar{
